<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-charnia-masoni-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Charnia masoni apical Turing wavelength at 140 µm (565 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The committed GIF is 12 frames at 640×1280. Its last frame scores 89.5 against the Tübingen cast on the canonical orientation / radial-FFT / coherency comparator. The panel shows the cast beside an upward chevron oval at 58°. It is a single-wavelength stylization: the cast's irregular outline, holdfast and higher-order rangeomorph elements are not reproduced, which is why this is not a higher score." ;
